rain
participant Ledger, Alice, Operators, 東京
ledger-operators: (Ledger)-[admin]->(Operators)
operators-alice: (Operators)-[edit(Ledger)]->(Alice) : over a long name
(東京)-[read]->(Alice)                          : wide characters 📱 in names and notes
(Alice)-[edit(Doc)]->(Ledger)                   : no authority over Doc: no powerline
(Alice)=[[admin]]=>(Ledger)                     : more than Alice holds
(Ledger)=[[edit]]=>(Ledger)                     : acting on yourself
(東京)-<revoke>-x[operators-alice]     : not upstream, so no effect (revoker right of its target)
(Ledger)-<revoke>-x[ledger-operators]  : the root revokes Ledger→Operators
